{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網絡近日瘋傳一段車Cam影片，有目擊者拍到一名「步兵」外賣員在黃大仙馬仔坑迴旋處，疑為節省時間而棄用旁邊的行人天橋，選擇直接闖入行車道切過迴旋處。影片中可見，該外賣員穿梭於車流之間，與途經車輛擦身而過，場面相當驚險。 </p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-07-12h00m52s467.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026mlcdJEuOVZ1791345928.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-07-12h00m52s467.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">樓主將影片上載至社交平台，大嘆外賣員過於冒險，留言指：「送外賣唔洗咁搏😅 而家啲人咩事 呢個迴旋處唔係第一次見有人行」。 </p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-07-12h00m54s941.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20260rSrDnXoUV1791345971.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-07-12h00m54s941.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">片段引發大批網民圍觀及熱議，眾人紛紛指責該外賣員忽視道路安全，並留言表達不滿與擔心，大批網民認為為送外賣冒險並不值得，留言指：「玩命送外賣，值咩？」 亦有網民指責其貪方便的心理，留言苦勸：「唔好貪方便呀！」、「遲早會出事。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T04:38:32.498057+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":282,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}